**Path:** `/workspace/repo/hadoop-hdds/interface-client/src/main/proto/DatanodeClientProtocol.proto`

This is the only .proto file defining these messages (lines 557–580). Full definitions:

```proto
// Each chunk contains multiple checksums. This message aggregates them into one checksum for the whole chunk.
